          "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nConsider a commutative diagram in a predeformation category <MATH_0001>\n<MATHSEG_0001>lying over<MATHSEG_0002>\nin <MATH_0002> where\n<MATH_0003> is a small extension.\nAssume there is a map <MATH_0004> such that <MATH_0005>.\nLet <MATH_0006>. Consider the ring map\n<MATH_0007>\nChoose a pushforward <MATH_0008>. Assume <MATH_0009> satisfies (S2).\nIf there exists a morphism <MATH_0010>, then there exists a\nmorphism <MATH_0011> such that <MATH_0012>.\n<STRUCT_0002>",
          "source_status": "CURRENT",
          "placeholders": {
            "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}",
            "LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-lifting-along-small-extension}",
            "MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{F}$",
            "MATHSEG_0001": "$$\n\\vcenter{\n\\xymatrix{\ny \\ar[r] \\ar[d] & x_2 \\ar[d]^{a_2} \\\\\nx_1 \\ar[r]^{a_1}        & x\n}\n}\n\\quad\\text{",
            "MATHSEG_0002": "}\n\\vcenter{\n\\xymatrix{\nA_1 \\times_A A_2 \\ar[r] \\ar[d] & A_2 \\ar[d]^{f_2} \\\\\nA_1 \\ar[r]^{f_1} & A\n}\n}\n$$",
            "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{C}_\\Lambda$",
            "MATH_0003": "$f_2 : A_2 \\to A$",
            "MATH_0004": "$h : A_1 \\to A_2$",
            "MATH_0005": "$f_2 = f_1 \\circ h$",
            "MATH_0006": "$I = \\Ker(f_2)$",
            "MATH_0007": "$$\ng : A_1 \\times_A A_2 \\longrightarrow k[I] = k \\oplus I, \\quad\n(u, v) \\longmapsto \\overline{u} \\oplus (v - h(u))\n$$",
            "MATH_0008": "$y \\to g_*y$",
            "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{F}$",
            "MATH_0010": "$x_1 \\to g_*y$",
            "MATH_0011": "$b: x_1 \\to x_2$",
            "MATH_0012": "$a_1 =  a_2 \\circ b$",
            "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{lemma}"
          },
